# `skills.set_var`

Set a KV variable (value_json) on a skill.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.skills.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `key` | `string` |
| `value_json` | `string` |

## Returns

`JsonResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
